      ],
      "pluginVersion": "13.0.3",
      "description": "A 99% target over 30 days is 7h 12m of failure you are *allowed* to spend. This is how much of it is left. Negative means the objective is already missed for the window. Prometheus here retains 15 days by default, so on a fresh stack this reads over whatever history exists rather than a true 30 days.",
